<p>Every module is self-contained and directly instantiable: <code>WebAssembly.instantiate(bytes)</code> in a browser or Node.js, or any standalone runtime, with each Python function available as a typed export. End-to-end compilation (parse through Binaryen) completes in under 20&nbsp;ms for these programs, making Waspy practical inside interactive tooling and build pipelines.</p>

